{"id":"A1-L081","title":"Prepositions of time: introduction","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U05","focus":"Prepositions of time — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Prepositions of time — introdução","pron":"ship/sheep","verbs":["make"],"pv":[],"expr":["go home"],"words":["schedule","rope","hammer","lock","September","fire","smoke","ice"],"field":"Trabalho","genre":"Notícia / reportagem curta","skill":"Leitura","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 81 · Prepositions of time: introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Prepositions of time — introdução.","**Verbos:** make.","**Expressões:** go home.","**Pronúncia:** ship/sheep.","**8 palavras novas** (trabalho).","**Texto do dia:** notícia / reportagem curta."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar in, on, at com tempo e ler uma notícia sobre horários."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["schedule","horário"],["rope","corda"],["hammer","martelo"],["lock","fechadura"],["September","setembro"],["fire","fogo"],["smoke","fumaça"],["ice","gelo"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A news report","blocks":[{"type":"news","headline":"Offices Change Hours","paras":["Starting **in** September, city offices will open **at** eight and close **at** four. They will stay closed **on** weekends and **on** public holidays.","“We **make** the new schedule **in** the morning and send it **on** Friday,” says the mayor.","Workers can **go home** early!"],"kicker":"LOCAL NEWS","by":"By Rae Holt","gloss":[["schedule","horário"],["public holiday","feriado"],["mayor","prefeito"],["change","mudança"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Offices open at eight.","ans":"T","why":"“at eight.”"},{"q":"Offices stay open on weekends.","ans":"F","why":"closed."},{"q":"The schedule is sent on Friday.","ans":"T","why":"“on Friday.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“schedule” means…","opts":["horário","agenda de contatos","calendário só"],"ans":0,"why":"schedule."},{"q":"“public holiday” means…","opts":["feriado","fim de semana","férias"],"ans":0,"why":"public holiday."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"in / on / at (time)","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Preposição","Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**at**","hora","**at eight**"],["**on**","dia/data","**on Friday, on May 5**"],["**in**","mês/ano/período","**in September, in 2026, in the morning**"]],"cap":"in / on / at (time)"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Exceções: **at night**, **at the weekend** (UK) / **on the weekend** (EUA)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The office opens ___ eight. (at)","a":"at","why":"hora."},{"s":"It is closed ___ Sunday. (on)","a":"on","why":"dia."},{"s":"It changes ___ September. (in)","a":"in","why":"mês."},{"s":"We ___ the schedule. (make)","a":"make","why":"make."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["schedule","horário"],["rope","corda"],["hammer","martelo"],["lock","fechadura"],["September","setembro"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["on","Saturday","Is","it","open"],"ans":"Is it open on Saturday","pt":"Abre no sábado?"},{"words":["weekends","No","it's","closed","on"],"ans":"No it's closed on weekends","pt":"Não, fecha nos fins de semana."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"schedule","pos":"word","pt":"horário","ex":"The new schedule.","expt":"O novo horário."},{"w":"rope","pos":"word","pt":"corda","ex":"A long rope.","expt":"Uma corda longa."},{"w":"hammer","pos":"word","pt":"martelo","ex":"A heavy hammer.","expt":"Um martelo pesado."},{"w":"lock","pos":"word","pt":"fechadura","ex":"The lock is broken.","expt":"A fechadura está quebrada."},{"w":"September","pos":"word","pt":"setembro","ex":"In September.","expt":"Em setembro."},{"w":"fire","pos":"word","pt":"fogo","ex":"A small fire.","expt":"Um fogo pequeno."},{"w":"smoke","pos":"word","pt":"fumaça","ex":"Black smoke.","expt":"Fumaça preta."},{"w":"ice","pos":"word","pt":"gelo","ex":"Ice in my drink.","expt":"Gelo na minha bebida."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**go home** — ir para casa","**What time does the office open?** — Que horas o escritório abre?","**At eight.** — Às oito.","**Is it open on Saturday?** — Abre no sábado?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"make","pt":"fazer","forms":[["I / you / we / they make","I make the schedule."],["he / she / it makes","She makes a plan."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Opening hours","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Opening hours","lines":[["Ana","What time does the office open?","Que horas o escritório abre?"],["Clerk","At eight.","Às oito."],["Ana","Is it open on Saturday?","Abre no sábado?"],["Clerk","No, it’s closed on weekends.","Não, fecha nos fins de semana."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: ship/sheep","items":[{"label":"ship/sheep","note":"/ɪ/ curto (ship) × /i/ longo (sheep).","words":["ship","sheep","sit","seat","live","leave"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say when you start and finish work.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I start at eight and finish at five."},{"q":"Say the month you were born.","pt":"Diga.","model":"My birthday is in May."},{"q":"Ask: What time does it open?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What time does it open?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with in, on, at.","model":"The office opens at eight. It closes at four. It is closed on weekends. The change is in September. I go home at five.","checklist":["Usei **at/on/in**","Usei **horário**","Usei **go home**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “schedule” mean?","opts":["corda","fechadura","horário"],"ans":2,"why":"**schedule** = horário."},{"q":"What does “rope” mean?","opts":["corda","martelo","setembro"],"ans":0,"why":"**rope** = corda."},{"q":"What does “hammer” mean?","opts":["fechadura","martelo","fogo"],"ans":1,"why":"**hammer** = martelo."},{"q":"What does “lock” mean?","opts":["setembro","fumaça","fechadura"],"ans":2,"why":"**lock** = fechadura."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}